act of selling these shares?", "Are you comfortable with the resulting drift in Canadian bonds?"]}, "thought_signature": "", "tokens_in": 2544, "tokens_out": 1470, "latency_ms": 4998, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "attempt": 1, "source": "live"}}
